+# Process audit — S5-CLM-00003502
+
+The worker claim is `S5THM-00003502-TARGET--worker` and owns only `S5THM-00003502-TARGET`.  The frozen record,
+source locator, Stage6 alias, and baseline digests are copied into `intake.json`.
+
+## Checklist
+
+- INTAKE: exact record and migration evidence bound.
+- STATEMENT: source definition and independent universe replay compile.
+- ANCHOR: pinned source anchor and local content digests recorded.
+- TREE: typed acyclic proof-unit graph with one readable anchor per node.
+- MACHINE: trust-zero local diagnostics compile; exact root remains open.
+- READABLE: every frontier node has a delimited reconstruction fragment.
+- VALIDATE: cold temporary-project replay, forbidden-token scan, JSON seal audit,
+  and claim self-check all pass.
+- RELEASE: provisional nonacceptance handoff awaits canonical Master review.
