+import AwesomeTheorems.Stage5.Theorems.S5_CLM_00003502.Statement
+
+/-!
+# Trust-zero diagnostic proof units
+
+The exact cancellation root is deliberately not asserted here.  These are
+the completed, kernel-checked transports and elementary consequences that
+make the open obligation explicit without importing a bodyless provider
+oracle or introducing a claim-specific assumption.
